	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "JLCPCB assembly tooling hole. Non-plated Ø1.152 mm (45.4 mil) round hole with 0.148 mm solder mask expansion per side (1.448 mm mask opening), per JLCPCB's 'How to add tooling holes for PCB assembly order'. Two or three of these are placed in opposite corners of the board, as far apart as practical, so the assembly line can locate the panel; JLCPCB adds its own if compliant ones are absent. Not a component: no copper, no BOM or position-file entry, no schematic symbol.")
